<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's BH H1 profit is 5.5 mln dinars.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's BH H1 profit is 5.5 mln dinars.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque de l'Habitat reported first half profits of 5.5 million dinars.</p>
<p>Figures for the same 1995 period were not available, but net profits in full 1995 were 9.33 million dinars, up 28.65 percent from 1994.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank specialises in housing loans.</p>
<p>BH this year raised its capital to 50 million dinars from 35 million. Its shares were last priced at 35.07 dinars on the Tunis Stock Exchange. ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
